OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer fears river crowds are
OL,4,Adrowning wildlife
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer has spoken of his fears that
OL,7,Fantisocial river users are scaring or
OL,8,Fdrowning local wildlife.
OL,10,FDaniel Bunting, who farms near Nayland
OL,11,Fin Suffolk, said most people using the
OL,12,FRiver Stour are "respectful", but some
OL,13,Fdisturb wildlife with motorised boats
OL,14,For by turning up in large groups,
OL,15,Fspeeding and playing music.
OL,17,FThe 52-year-old said the 25ft wide
OL,18,F(7.6m) stretch of water was not
OL,19,Fdesigned for crowds or fast-moving
OL,20,Fcraft.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
