OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer fears river crowds are
OL,4,Adrowning wildlife
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We're having boats on the river from
OL,7,Ffirst thing in the morning to last
OL,8,Fthing at night and they just don't get
OL,9,Fany peace," he said. "If you get a wake
OL,10,Fit would actually drown the kingfisher
OL,11,Fchicks because they're in little holes
OL,12,Fin the bank. This year we haven't got
OL,13,Fany."
